SUMMARY:GLORYHAMMER (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Arena
DESCRIPTION: | Arena Wien - Große Halle | presented by MIND OVER MATTER  GLORYHAMMER  5th Album Release Tour 2026  Support: Majestica & Arion  10. November 2026  Arena WienEinlass: 18:00 Uhr | Beginn: 19:00 Uhr  Ticket sind ab 12.12. 10:00 Uhr hier erhältlich: https://bit.ly/GloryhammerArenaWien  Mighty warriors of the galaxy! GLORYHAMMER has returned from an epic quest\, and they come bearing their new album\, "LEGENDS FROM BEYOND THE GALACTIC TERRORVORTEX". In this thrilling third chapter of the Gloryhammer saga\, we follow the legendary prince Angus McFife into another dimension\, where he will fight with more terrifying foes and embark on more epic adventures than ever before. Join his quest to save the Kingdom of Fife\, through 10 tracks of nuclear-fueled high-velocity heroic power metal\, the likes of which you've never heard in your life. FOR THE ETERNAL GLORY OF DUNDEE!  Tickets sind ab Freitag\, 12. Dezember 2025 via oeticket.com und in allen bekannten Vorverkaufsstellen erhältlich! 
URL:https://arena.wien/Home/Programm-Detail/concert-id/48433
